{"recordId":"general_博爾忽_900505218","name":"博爾忽","type":"general","dynasty":"元朝","title":"蒙古四駿","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"博爾忽","pageId":1455569,"revisionId":88630857,"revisionTimestamp":"2025-08-07T15:30:14Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%8D%9A%E7%88%BE%E5%BF%BD","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=88630857","wikidataId":"Q852196","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"蒙古秘史","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"},{"citationTitle":"蒙古秘史現代漢語版","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:37:05.327Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:yuanshi","source:mingshi"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-d7996dde403fc856","query":"博爾忽","count":1,"offset":411,"excerpt":"也可〔怯薛〕及合剌赤所部衞士自運軍糧，〔也可〔怯薛〕　據本書卷九九兵志及卷一一九博爾忽傳補。按蒙古語「也可」言「大」，「也可怯薛」即「第一怯薛」。月赤察而至元十七年長第一怯薛。〕給其行費。甲午，授嗣漢三十八代天師張與材太素凝神廣道真人，管領江南諸","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-26924f2716830771","query":"博爾忽","count":7,"offset":24,"excerpt":"〔篇題：列傳第六〕\n〔編者說明：木華黎　博魯朮　博爾忽〕\n\n木華黎〔〔孛魯　塔思　速渾察　乃燕　霸突魯　塔塔兒台　脫脫〕〕〔〔孛魯塔思速渾察乃燕霸突魯塔塔兒台脫脫〕　據本書原目錄補。原目錄脫脫錯列速渾察下，今據傳文","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:yuanshi-2b2f1799d78b71df","query":"博爾忽","count":1,"offset":1410,"excerpt":"，必命近臣敷宣王度，以為告戒。脫脫薦只兒哈忽，令具其言以進，果稱旨。武宗歎曰：「博爾忽、博爾朮前朝人傑，脫脫今世人傑也。」即以所進之言授脫脫。及諸王大臣被宴服就列，脫脫即席陳西北諸藩始終離合之由、去逆效順之義，辭旨明暢，聽者傾服。自同知樞密院事進","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:mingshi-49ffb40db906f1df","query":"博爾忽","count":1,"offset":1286,"excerpt":"亮、房玄齡、杜如晦、李靖、郭子儀、李晟、曹彬、潘美、韓世忠、岳飛、張浚、木華黎、博爾忽、博爾術、赤老溫、伯顏，凡三十七人，從祀於東西廡，為壇四。初，太公望有武成王廟。嘗遣官致祭如釋奠儀。至是，罷廟祭，去王號。\n\n　　永樂遷都，帝王廟遣南京太常寺官","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":4,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:yuanshi-d7996dde403fc856","bookId":"book:yuanshi","requestedTitle":"元史/卷019","title":"元史/卷019","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7019","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2642613","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E5%85%83%E5%8F%B2%2F%E5%8D%B7019?action=history","revisionId":2642613,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-01-17T06:28:53Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:57:08.351Z","sha256":"fa638448a5196400f11fb2b301e3afea306f719e1b15acae52712b2e56aa1651","textSha256":"b8cbe42bfe4b6504e85a3740021533b4639e5f4ca15a834097ac2596b668315d","expandedWikitextSha256":"fa638448a5196400f11fb2b301e3afea306f719e1b15acae52712b2e56aa1651","characters":12238,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/yuanshi.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:41.673Z","upstreamTextQuality":50,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 50% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/e70831d9c8b70ab97432.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/wikitext/e70831d9c8b70ab97432.json","relatedDocumentIds":[]},{"id":"document:yuanshi-26924f2716830771","bookId":"book:yuanshi","requestedTitle":"元史/卷119","title":"元史/卷119